          "title": "You'll want to know: ફાયદો",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ફાયદો — phāydo — \"a benefit\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો તમે વહેલા ટિકિટ ખરીદશો તો ફાયદો થશે. jo tame vahelā ṭikiṭ kharīdśo to phāydo thaśe. If you buy the tickets early, you will save."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ફાયદો (phāydo) is usually traced to Arabic fāʾida, \"a benefit, a profit\", through Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
